# SparkRing code owners.
#
# There is exactly one maintainer today. @FujitsuPolycom is the owner of
# github.com/FujitsuPolycom/sparkring and the author of every commit on
# `main`; no other GitHub account, team, or email is asserted here, because
# no other one is verifiable from this repository.
#
# This file exists so that review is requested automatically rather than by
# memory. It is not a claim that a second reviewer exists. When more
# maintainers join, split the paths below by area instead of adding everyone
# to the catch-all.
#
# NOTE: CODEOWNERS only has an effect once branch protection on `main`
# requires review. Until then it is documentation.

# Catch-all.
*                               @FujitsuPolycom

# Hardware-coupled code. Changes here cannot be validated by CI (no GPU, no
# RDMA fabric, no four-Spark ring on a hosted runner) and always need a
# maintainer to run the hardware gate.
/spark_transport/               @FujitsuPolycom
/sparkcache/native/             @FujitsuPolycom

# The fail-closed runtime overlay and its pins. A wrong preimage hash here
# turns a fail-closed refusal into a silent misbehaviour.
/runtime/                       @FujitsuPolycom

